# Stores are never tracked. Root-anchored on purpose (ADR D1, amended 2026-08-02): a bare
# `memento/` would untrack a source package named `memento` at any depth — including this repo's
# own `src/memento/`. The default directory name changed; the anchoring is the load-bearing half.
# `/memory/` stays for stores that predate the rename; nothing on disk has to move.
/memento/
/memory/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store
mutants/
.mutmut-cache
